@HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### Create Player Profile
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/Profile/PlayerProfiles
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <Your_Token_Here>

{
  "showName": "JohnD",
  "fullName": "John Doe",
  "photoPath": "path/to/photo.jpg",
  "password": "StrongPassword123!",
  "playerNumber": 10,
  "tShirtName": "DOE",
  "medicalStatus": 0,
  "currentMainPosition": 1,
  "otherAvailablePositions": 2,
  "performanceLevel": 8.5,
  "dateOfEnrolment": "2026-06-15"
}

### Create Team Staff Profile
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/Profile/TeamStaffProfiles
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <Your_Token_Here>

{
  "showName": "CoachJane",
  "fullName": "Jane Smith",
  "photoPath": "path/to/photo2.jpg",
  "password": "StrongPassword123!",
  "insuranceFilesLink": "path/to/insurance.pdf",
  "contractFilesLink": "path/to/contract.pdf",
  "role": 0
}
